            "paragraph": "The simulated gross primary productivity (GPP) is within the range of observations, but simulated net primary productivity (NPP) is slightly too high. ... NPP from 2000 to 2013 is 72 Pg Cyr\u00af\u00b9, compared to satellite-derived NPP of 55 Pg Cyr\u00af\u00b9 over the same period and independent estimates of 56.2\u00b114.3 Pg Cyr-1.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": false,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "JULES",
            "source_entity_type": "Source",
            "relation": "HAS_METRIC",
            "target_entity_instance": "Vegetation Carbon",
            "target_entity_type": "Metric",
            "paragraph": "The simulated carbon stored in vegetation is 542 Pg C, compared to an observation-based range of 400-600 Pg C.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "JULES",
            "source_entity_type": "Source",
            "relation": "HAS_METRIC",
            "target_entity_instance": "Soil Carbon",
            "target_entity_type": "Metric",
            "paragraph": "Soil carbon is much lower (1422 Pg C) than estimates from measurements (> 2400 Pg C), with large underestimations of soil carbon in the tropical and boreal forests.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": false,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "JULES",
            "source_entity_type": "Source",
            "relation": "HAS_METRIC",
            "target_entity_instance": "land carbon sink",
            "target_entity_type": "Metric",
            "paragraph": "The simulated land carbon sink is 2.0 \u00b1 1.0PgCyr\u00af\u00b9 from 2000 to 2009, in close agreement with estimates from the IPCC and Global Carbon Project.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": false,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "JULES",
            "source_entity_type": "Source",
            "relation": "APPLIES_TO_REALM",
            "target_entity_instance": "land",
            "target_entity_type": "Realm",
            "paragraph": "JULES (the Joint UK Land Environment Simulator) represents the land surface in the Hadley Centre climate models and in the UK Earth System Model.",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
