            "target_entity_instance": "offline",
            "target_entity_type": "SimulationType",
            "paragraph": "This paper aims to demonstrate the overall performance of the new version of JULES in offline (not coupled to a climate model) simulations compared to both independent data sources and a previous version of the model.",
