            "target_entity_type": "Project",
            "paragraph": "JULES (Best et al., 2011; Clark et al., 2011) is a DGVM that represents the land surface in the UK Hadley Centre family of models (e.g., the UK Earth System Model in the 6th phase of the Coupled Model Intercomparison Project, CMIP6, and the HadGEM2 models in CMIP3 and CMIP5).",
